    "chunk_text": "t folc syngie, offrie Drihtne unwemme cealf. & l\u00e6de hit to \u00fe\u00e6s temples dura. Nime \u00feonne of \u00fe\u00e6s cealfes blode & sprencge seofon sy\u00feon on \u00f0\u00e6s temples wahryft. Gyf eall Israhela folc singa\u00f0 \u00feurh ungewiss, bringe an cealf to \u00feam temple, & l\u00e6de hit to \u00f0\u00e6re dura. & setton \u00fe\u00e6s folces ealdoran hyra handa uppan his heafod, & \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6t cealf geoffrod sy, nime se & smite of \u00f0am sylfan blode on \u00fe\u00e6s weofodes hyrnan, & geote \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6r to lafe bi\u00f0 \u00e6t \u00f0am weofode & b\u00e6rne \u00feone rysel uppan \u00feam weofode. & gebidde se sacerd for hi. & forb\u00e6rne \u00fe\u00e6t cealf butan \u00f0\u00e6re wicstowe. Gyf se ealdor synga\u00f0, bringe anne buccan to bote. Gyf folces man synga\u00f0 \u00feurh nytennysse & his gilt undergyt, bringe ane gat to bote to \u00f0am temole. Gyf man wat \u00fe\u00e6t o\u00f0er man swera\u00fe, he bi\u00f0 scyldig gyf he hit forhyl\u00f0. Se man \u00fee swera\u00f0 man & eft his gilt ongyt bringe an cylferlamb to bote, o\u00fe\u00fee gat, for hine & for his & gyf he nyten n\u00e6bbe, bringe twa turtlan o\u00f0\u00f0e twegen culfran briddas, \u00e6nne for \u00fe\u00e6re synne, o\u00feerne to Gyf he n\u00e6bbe turtlan ne culfran, bringe melu. Drihten spr\u00e6c to Moyse, & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00fe: Beod Aarone & his sunum \u00fe\u00e6t hi bringon Drihtne to offrunge, Ne ete nan man of \u00fe\u00e6ra sacerda offr",
